# Design quality (Flutter lib)

When editing any file under `flutter_app/lib/**`:

1. Read root `DESIGN.md` and `.cursor/skills/design-quality/SKILL.md`.
2. Prefer `HexaColors` / `HexaDsColors` / `HexaDsType` / `HexaDsSpace` over raw `Color(0x…)` and inline font sizes.
3. Use `FriendlyLoadError` / `HexaErrorCard` for load errors; never show Dio/HTTP/stack to users.
4. Desktop: `showHexaBottomSheet` for sheets; `DesktopPageShell` for forms (max 720).
5. Preserve purchase draft / trade save flows and ₹ formatting (`en_IN`).
6. Self-check the design-quality skill checklist before finishing.
